{
  "_doc": [
    "Per-ticket requirements for gdd-agent.js. Probes are auto-extracted from each Roadmap ticket's Acceptance text;",
    "this file adds what the text does not name, links tickets to their GDD section, and records deliberate renames.",
    "gdd: DeadwaterRun.md heading(s) the ticket implements, or \"none\" for tooling. Unknown headings fail the run.",
    "probes: extra {kind, name, min?, exclude?} (min/exclude: count asset globs); kinds: symbol (C++ type declared in Source/), asset (Content file name, * allowed),",
    "file (repo path, * allowed), test (automation test name registered in Source/), text (regex over Source/).",
    "ignore: auto-extracted names that are not requirements. rename: ticket name -> name it shipped under.",
    "replaceProbes: true drops the auto-extracted probes. writable: override whether the loop may pick it."
  ],
  "tickets": {
